:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"Avatar\n├── AvatarImage\n├── AvatarFallback\n└── AvatarBadge\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Avatar</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── AvatarImage</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── AvatarFallback</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>└── AvatarBadge</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Use the following composition to build an <code>AvatarGroup</code>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"AvatarGroup\n├── Avatar\n│   ├── AvatarImage\n│   ├── AvatarFallback\n│   └── AvatarBadge\n├── Avatar\n│   ├── AvatarImage\n│   ├── AvatarFallback\n│   └── AvatarBadge\n└── AvatarGroupCount\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>AvatarGroup</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── Avatar</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── AvatarImage</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── AvatarFallback</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   └── AvatarBadge</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── Avatar</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── AvatarImage</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── AvatarFallback</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   └── AvatarBadge</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>└── AvatarGroupCount</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"basic\">Basic</h2>\n<p>A basic avatar component with an image and a fallback.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-basic&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"badge\">Badge</h2>\n<p>Use the <code>AvatarBadge</code> component to add a badge to the avatar. The badge is positioned at the bottom right of the avatar.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-badge&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<p>Use the <code>className</code> prop to add custom styles to the badge such as custom colors, sizes, etc.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"<Avatar>\n  <AvatarImage src=&#x22;https://github.com/shadcn.png&#x22; alt=&#x22;@shadcn&#x22; />\n  <AvatarFallback>CN</AvatarFallback>\n  <AvatarBadge className=&#x22;bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-800&#x22; />\n</Avatar>\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Avatar</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">AvatarImage</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> src</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://github.com/shadcn.png\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> alt</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"@shadcn\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">AvatarFallback</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">CN</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">AvatarFallback</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">AvatarBadge</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> className</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-800\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Avatar</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"badge-with-icon\">Badge with Icon</h2>\n<p>You can also use an icon inside <code>&#x3C;AvatarBadge></code>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-badge-icon&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"avatar-group\">Avatar Group</h2>\n<p>Use the <code>AvatarGroup</code> component to add a group of avatars.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-group&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"avatar-group-count\">Avatar Group Count</h2>\n<p>Use <code>&#x3C;AvatarGroupCount></code> to add a count to the group.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-group-count&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"avatar-group-with-icon\">Avatar Group with Icon</h2>\n<p>You can also use an icon inside <code>&#x3C;AvatarGroupCount></code>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-group-count-icon&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"sizes\">Sizes</h2>\n<p>Use the <code>size</code> prop to change the size of the avatar.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-size&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"dropdown\">Dropdown</h2>\n<p>You can use the <code>Avatar</code> component as a trigger for a dropdown menu.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-dropdown&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"rtl\">RTL</h2>\n<p>To enable RTL support in shadcn/ui, see the <a href=\"/docs/rtl\">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;avatar-rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;direction&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-72&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference\">API Reference</h2>\n<h3 id=\"avatar\">Avatar</h3>\n<p>The <code>Avatar</code> component is the root component that wraps the avatar image and fallback.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Prop</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>size</code></td>\n<td><code>\"default\" | \"sm\" | \"lg\"</code></td>\n<td><code>\"default\"</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>className</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"avatarimage\">AvatarImage</h3>\n<p>The <code>AvatarImage</code> component displays the avatar image.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Prop</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>src</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>alt</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>className</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"avatarfallback\">AvatarFallback</h3>\n<p>The <code>AvatarFallback</code> component displays a fallback when the image fails to load.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Prop</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>className</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"avatarbadge\">AvatarBadge</h3>\n<p>The <code>AvatarBadge</code> component displays a badge indicator on the avatar, typically positioned at the bottom right.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Prop</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>className</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"avatargroup\">AvatarGroup</h3>\n<p>The <code>AvatarGroup</code> component displays a group of avatars with overlapping styling.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Prop</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>className</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"avatargroupcount\">AvatarGroupCount</h3>\n<p>The <code>AvatarGroupCount</code> component displays a count indicator in an avatar group, typically showing the number of additional avatars.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Prop</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>className</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
